        "slug": "architecture-plan-presentation-animation",
        "title": "Architecture Plan Presentation & Animation",
        "tagline": "Create Professional Architectural Presentations from CAD Drawings to Animated Visuals",
        "description": "Learn how to transform ordinary AutoCAD drawings into stunning architectural presentation sheets and professional animation presentations using industry-standard techniques. This course is designed for architecture students, civil engineering students, interior designers, and professionals who want to improve the quality of their project presentations. The programme is designed for beginners and aspiring professionals, with a clear focus on practical execution, production standards and portfolio-ready outcomes.",
        "cover_url": "/uploads/images/img-1786958890218-a32f5f983d2f.jpeg",
