        "what_you_will_learn": [
          "Install and configure Adobe Photoshop for architectural presentation.",
          "Understand the fundamentals of architectural plan presentation.",
          "Set up AutoCAD drawings for Photoshop workflow.",
          "Export high-quality CAD drawings for presentation.",
          "Create professional floor plan presentations.",
          "Apply colors, textures, shadows, and presentation effects.",
          "Add furniture, landscape, people, vehicles, and presentation elements.",
          "Create presentation boards suitable for client meetings and portfolios.",
          "Produce animated architectural presentations from presentation boards.",
          "Export presentation images and animation in high quality.",
          "Download and use all course practice files and resources..",
          "Build presentation skills used by architecture firms and design studios."
        ],
        "tools_covered": [
          "Architecture & Interior Design"
        ],
        "highlights": [
