          "Practice Exercises Animation Project Files",
          "Lifetime Access Mobile & Desktop Access Course Completion Certificate"
        ],
        "requirements": [
          "Basic knowledge of AutoCAD is recommended.",
          "A Windows PC or Mac with Adobe Photoshop installed.",
          "AutoCAD software for preparing architectural drawings.",
          "No prior Photoshop experience is required.",
          "Internet connection for downloading course materials.",
          "Passion for creating professional architectural presentations.",
          "Willingness to practice using the provided project files."
        ],
